flowchart LR
  Catalog[Canonical catalog<br/>49 monitoring-required physical switches] --> Plan[Identity-aware dry run]
  Collector[Collector inventory<br/>exact operator locations] --> Plan
  Plan --> Match{One row by canonical<br/>IP or hostname?}
  Match -->|Split or duplicate identity| Stop[Stop without changes]
  Match -->|Existing alias| Move[Keep row ID and move it<br/>to canonical management IP]
  Match -->|Missing| Insert[Insert with unknown status]
  Match -->|Exact| Update[Update canonical fields]
  Move --> Backup[Write before snapshot]
  Insert --> Backup
  Update --> Backup
  Backup --> Transaction[One PostgreSQL transaction]
  Transaction --> Nodes[(net_nodes<br/>Fred topology and AI)]
  Transaction --> Inventory[(network_switches<br/>Fred inventory and NOC dashboard)]
  Nodes --> Verify[Validate all 49 in both tables]
  Inventory --> Verify
  Verify --> Evidence[Write after snapshot]
